    "detailed_description": "<h1>Regarding the questions you might have</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game length</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b8 The full multiplayer experience takes about 90 minutes, so if the game length doesn't satisfy you, I'll understand if you get a refund.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Suggestions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b8 Stop for some time if possible, you're welcome to think and deconstruct the design of it, like watching an interesting film</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b8 Pay attention to the fragmented narrative like reading a novel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b8 Feel free to control the pace of the experience as you would an art gallery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u25b8 It's not surprising what happens here. If you find something suspicious, maybe it's not triggering a bug, but it's inherently part of the game.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452940/extras/4fea2b4d554462fc23fcb852c28cd415.poster.avif?t=1739537920\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452940/extras/4fea2b4d554462fc23fcb852c28cd415.webm?t=1739537920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452940/extras/4fea2b4d554462fc23fcb852c28cd415.mp4?t=1739537920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A mysterious movie theater flyer...... A man who hasn't been home for a long time...... Surprising secrets about the video medium...... How extraterrestrial and cosmic life flows...... It's a love letter to the art of cinema, a chilling reflection. \u201d</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452940/extras/7ddc940ce3733f1eec42edb40ce84de2.poster.avif?t=1739537920\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452940/extras/7ddc940ce3733f1eec42edb40ce84de2.webm?t=1739537920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452940/extras/7ddc940ce3733f1eec42edb40ce84de2.mp4?t=1739537920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Prism: Master Tape</i> takes you deep into a place that sits on the edge of reality and transcends conventional perception. As you follow in the footsteps of the protagonist as they explore objects and move forward, &quot;they&quot; always call you: &quot;No. 237 ......&quot; - and thus begins this extraordinary adventure in an interactive clicker game with a side-scrolling third-person object perspective and a first-person subject perspective.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452940/extras/94770f1dcbc654e7a33490ed8ce9857d.poster.avif?t=1739537920\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452940/extras/94770f1dcbc654e7a33490ed8ce9857d.webm?t=1739537920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452940/extras/94770f1dcbc654e7a33490ed8ce9857d.mp4?t=1739537920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Prism: Master Tape\u00a0</i>somewhat eschews traditional gameplay in favor of a purely story-driven experience, where you can't save and read files, as if you were going to the cinema to watch a movie. Blends eerie environments, white noise, poetry, and narrated texts to weave a story with a novel perspective on the flow of life in the universe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452940/extras/6790f39de52228924dbb0347418b5499.poster.avif?t=1739537920\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452940/extras/6790f39de52228924dbb0347418b5499.webm?t=1739537920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452940/extras/6790f39de52228924dbb0347418b5499.mp4?t=1739537920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many of the images here are a tribute to the art of cinema, and every corner hides secrets waiting to be discovered. The player is not only solving the puzzle, but also experiencing a reflection: thinking about the delicate relationship between human and media development, reality and illusion. When all the clues come together into a complete picture, you will revisit your definition of &quot;real&quot; and find your own way out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452940/extras/1c6da1cef1de333ca2551cf07f534350.poster.avif?t=1739537920\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452940/extras/1c6da1cef1de333ca2551cf07f534350.webm?t=1739537920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452940/extras/1c6da1cef1de333ca2551cf07f534350.mp4?t=1739537920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember, don't overlook a movie that may &quot;not exist&quot;. And you may be part of the movie. Give yourself time to watch and perform one of these &quot;movies&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>something to say</strong></h2></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the first title from Hilltop Games 0x0 Game studio. For various reasons, the game was completed in its entirety by me alone. Writing this, at this moment I don't seem to have any regrets.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0-XuRongzhi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
